  Hmm.  Let me tell you guys a story.  I am here at the U of U, minding my
own business, when some dudes from a.r.k. come into a group I was reading,
and start to troll people.  For those of you who don't know what this is,
it is simply posting inflammatory or strange posts to a group or series of
groups, and setting the followup line for a million other groups.  You know I am
not the kind to want to censor people, so I found it totally inappropriate to
write a letter to the postmaster at the site responsible.  
  I did however, take it upon myself to post an informational message to
every single one of these cross post troll which were contained on a.r.k. 
They seemed to not like this, and complained in medium numbers(4-6,people,
30 messages) to my postmaster.  He pulled my account, for a short time,
until I made a phone call to his superior, at which time my account was
PROMPTLY reinstated. I am in the process of writing a paper letter to
him, his boss, his bosses boss, and my lawyer.
  It would seem that there are a bunch of whimps on a.r.k who hide their
own behavior behind freedom of speech, and the ability to use kill files
if you don't like what they are doing, but don't apply the same standard
to themselves.
  In short, the behavior they would like censored it a short followup to a
troll across a couple of relevant groups labeling their post as
originating on alt.religion.kibology.  I would encourage anyone interested
in defying hypocritical net-cops to take a little time to engage in this
behavior on alt.religion.kibiology(after verifying that what I say is
true, of cource), and show them that censorship is not acceptable, and that
they can't intimidate everyone.
  They have also been guilty of mail-bombing, and repeated harassment, but I
have shrugged this off.  I will not in the future:-)
  A list of the individuals involved, as well as their posts, can be
obtained from me.
  Please feel free to contact me with serious questions or for discussion
about my behavior, but if you send me flame-mail, or a useless request
that I stop when I have said I would not, I will be reporting it to your
postmaster and the next level up.  I have not done this until now.

Have a nice day.

Roger.

P.S. The future posts on a.r.k via anonymous server have nothing to do
with me, so you can go to hell and leave me alone. na, na, na na, na.


